type: software
title: skyscapes
abstract: "skyscapes is an open-source JAX library for astrophysical scene modeling, assembling stars, planets, debris disks, and zodiacal and exozodiacal dust into surface-brightness scenes for Habitable Worlds Observatory direct imaging simulations."
